+### `pick_new_host` — Pick New Host
+
+```text
+pick_new_host {"id": "@w1", "wall": "@box.ids.2", "offset": 3000}
+```
+
+`id` is the existing door/window; `wall` is an explicit different target wall. Both accept an id or GUID. `offset` is the
+family insertion point's distance from the target wall's start, in millimetres (the opening centre for a default origin).
+It changes only the host and offset through the
+shared command engine and returns the updated element. The restrictions and preservation rules above apply equally to
+MCP and scripts. It adds one Undo step, or none if refused.
